[00:19.26]How great our need today for discernment,
[00:25.28]To know the things that are true,
[00:31.24]To know which things have greater importance,
[00:37.40]To know which things we must do!
[00:42.33](Chorus)
[00:42.48]Love what is good; Hate what is bad.
[00:48.62]Make God’s heart glad;
[00:51.24]Oh, what rich blessings it brings when we learn,
[00:57.68]When we discern,
[01:00.82]And when we do the important things!
[01:08.16]And what could be of greater importance
[01:14.20]Than sharing Kingdom good news,
[01:19.70]To search for those who hunger for truth
[01:25.70]And to help them God’s way to choose?
[01:31.15](Chorus)
[01:31.30]Love what is good; Hate what is bad.
[01:37.28]Make God’s heart glad;
[01:40.20]Oh, what rich blessings it brings when we learn,
[01:46.60]When we discern,
[01:49.22]And when we do the important things!
[02:06.79]If we take care to do what’s important,
[02:13.76]Then true contentment we’ll find.
[02:19.92]The peace surpassing all understanding
[02:25.72]Will guard our heart and our mind.
[02:30.87](Chorus)
[02:31.02]Love what is good; Hate what is bad.
[02:37.27]Make God’s heart glad;
[02:39.87]Oh, what rich blessings it brings when we learn,
[02:46.35]When we discern,
[02:49.53]And when we do the important things!
